member.summary:
Unit-level facts of one campaign candidate. LatestDue is the newest due date among the unit's payments in the filtered window (the list is ordered by it, newest first). Flags is a  mask;
            Amount is null when the unit's stage instalments are ambiguous. FullName / Phone / Email are the LINKED contact (CRM first, PACT completing, see
            CollectionsContactLinker); CrmStatus is 0 (CRM holds no eligible sale / not loaded), 1 (one customer) or 2 (several: review).

