The unit/account directory entry of a unit key: Matches are the (company, tenant, unit id) rows of the exact unit code (fully paid units included, cancelled codes never); AccountUnits
are EVERY unit of those accounts, paid or not. IsComplete says whether the SOURCE is accepted as listing every unit of a tenant account (a statement may only be shown for one unit when it is);
it is false unless an operator verified the source live. Source names where the directory comes from.

